        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Handkerchief of bobbin lace worked in silk, Malta, 1850-1899"@en , "Handkerchief of bobbin lace worked in silk. Round centre of white silk with a deep border of cream silk bobbin lace. Maltese pattern of crosses and stars of wheat ears joined by plaited brides. Over-all design of circles and of circles within squares. Scalloped edge. The lace is made in narrow strips and then joined together."@en ;
